    {
      "id": "p0066-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Undertale's initial translation began in February 2016, and the first draft was completed eight weeks later. This first draft underwent many edits and fixes over the following months, and was continually adjusted before the game's release in August 2017.",
        "raw": "Underta/e's initial translation began in February 2016, and the first draft was\ncompleted eight weeks later. This first draft underwent many edits and fixes\nover the following months, and was continually adjusted before the game's\nrelease in August 2017.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28980495,
          0.16690714,
          0.87587193,
          0.23431429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28727915,
          0.16619286,
          0.8919739,
          0.23538571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          5,
          6,
          7,
          8
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Undertale 的初译于2016年2月开始，八周后完成第一稿。接下来几个月，这份稿子经过多次编辑与修正，并一直调整到2017年8月游戏发行前。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 9,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
