    {
      "id": "p0066-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Undertale's text localization was done via spreadsheet, which is standard for most professional game localizations. Undertale's spreadsheets contained all of the original English text, explanatory notes from Toby, notes from the translator, notes from the editors, supplementary and technical information, and more. These spreadsheets are brimming with inside information, some of which we'll examine throughout this book.",
        "raw": "Underta/e's text localization was done via spreadsheet, which is standard for\nmost professional game localizations. Underta/e's spreadsheets contained\nall of the original English text, explanatory notes from Toby, notes from the\ntranslator, notes from the editors, supplementary and technical information,\nand more. These spreadsheets are brimming with inside information, some of\nwhich we'll examine throughout this book.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28980495,
          0.24962143,
          0.88993696,
          0.35352143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28727915,
          0.24890714,
          0.8919739,
          0.35459286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          9,
          10,
          11,
          12,
          13,
          14
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Undertale 通过电子表格进行文字本地化，这也是多数职业游戏本地化的标准做法。表格里有全部英语原文、Toby 的说明、译者笔记、编辑意见、补充资料、技术信息等，充满了内部信息。本书将陆续介绍其中一些。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 9,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
